  introText: {fileID: 1719011142}
  lines:
  - "What you lost - memory is still in the <color=#FF3B3B><b> school </b></color>, 
    \n\nIf you want to know who you are, \n<color=#FF3B3B><b> go back to where the
    snow fell in the school. </b></color> \n\nAnd <color=#FF3B3B><b> don\u2019t go
    in with your real face. </b></color>"
